      "explanation": "<p>Let <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.17ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 517 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> be the charge density of the spherical charge distribution of radius r<sub>1</sub> centred at the origin O. A spherical cavity of radius r<sub>2</sub> centred at P with distance OP = a = r<sub>1</sub> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> r<sub>2</sub> is made in the spherical charge distribution.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2015 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Electrostatics Question 53 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l0ylv7iz/24858224-e5bf-4e7c-ad02-a36838e6378d/c7a5eab0-a7ed-11ec-82ec-9768dcc201cf/file-1l0ylv7j0.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>The sphere with cavity is equivalent to a sphere of uniform charge density <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.17ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 517 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and radius r<sub>2</sub> centred at P embedded in the original sphere. Thus, the electric field at a point Q in the cavity is superposition of (i) electric field at Q due to the sphere of charge density <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.17ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 517 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and radius r<sub>1</sub> centred at O (say <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.521ex\" height=\"3.183ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1407 1114.5 1407\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(131,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(114.5,796)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>1</sub>), and (ii) electric field at Q due to the sphere of charge density <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.17ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 517 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and radius r<sub>2</sub> centred at P (say <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.521ex\" height=\"3.183ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1407 1114.5 1407\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(131,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(114.5,796)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><sub>2</sub>). Let <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.312ex\" height=\"2.667ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1169 1022 1179\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(235.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(22,558)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.31ex\" height=\"2.67ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1169 1021 1180\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(274.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(21,558)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.31ex\" height=\"2.67ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1169 1021 1180\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(274.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(21,558)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(